### PR DEPENDENCY VALIDATION (Prevents Chain Breaks)
Before reviewing code quality, verify PR dependencies:
1. Check PR description for "Depends on: PR #[N]"
2. Verify dependency PR is MERGED (not just open)
3. If dependency not merged → Mark PR as BLOCKED, do not approve
4. Check for merge conflicts with main → Flag as CRITICAL if conflicts

