Every PR must be auto-merge ready:
- [ ] All CI checks passing (tests, lint, type-check)
- [ ] No merge conflicts with main
- [ ] Dependencies satisfied (dependent PRs merged)
- [ ] Documentation updated
- [ ] Tests comprehensive
- [ ] Security review passed (no BLOCKER/MAJOR issues)

**Never approve a PR that will fail auto-merge** - it blocks the next day's agents

